ckers Brands » Deloitte » General Motors » Goldman Sachs » Google, Inc. (Alphabet) » Lockheed Martin » Netflix » Northrop Grumman Corp. » Oracle NetSuite » Peloton Interactive » PricewaterhouseCoopers » Procore Technologies » Raytheon Technologies/RTX » UBS » Walt Disney Company » Yardi Systems » Zoom Video Communications, Inc. CAMPUS RESOURCES CAREER RESOURCE CENTER The Career Resource Center walks alongside you to help you discover your strengths, explore the workplace through internships and jobs, connect with alumni in similar fields, and find God’s direction for your life. INTERNSHIPS Internships are a great way to “test drive” a career. 70% of Westmont students participate in internships, many of which can be completed for academic credit. LAY THE GROUNDWORK FOR GRADUATE SCHOOL WE PLACE A HIGH VALUE ON RESEARCH » Conduct research one-on-one with a professor » Develop your own research projects » Join professors in their work » State-of-the-art equipment » Summer intensive sessions in the lab— experience the life of a scientist » Opportunities for all majors! Check out westmont.edu/research to read about what students and professors are currently researching. STORIES OF SUCCESS Valentina Costarelli ’23 has long been fascinated by the intersection of science, tech, and finance. Originally, Valentina’s interests led her to attend Caltech. During the pandemic, she transferred to Westmont where she delved deeply into these disciplines with faculty who challenged and encouraged her not only academically but also spiritually. At Westmont, she found herself thriving in a community of faith. Valentina’s Westmont education and robust internships prepared her for transformational roles in technology and led to her current position as a software developer with Amazon Web Services in Seattle, WA. TOP GRADUATE SCHOOLS WESTMONT ALUMNI HAVE ATTENDED HEALTHCARE » University of California San Francisco (UCSF) » University of Michigan » Duke University » University of Southern C